  infl:'Rates by year. A blank year uses the Default; upside and downside cases shift the Default.', vac:'Vacancy and credit loss reduce income before expenses.', credit:'Credit loss is charged on rent; choose what it is charged on.', lease:'Concessions and loss to lease reduce rent before vacancy.', rent:'Market rent against what the rent roll says is in place.',
